{"id":"e406e8afb48a5978","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Precipitous Ideal","display":"df-zfc-precipitous-ideal — ZFC Precipitous Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-precipitous-ideal — ZFC Precipitous Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-precipitous-ideal — ZFC Precipitous Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(I,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ideal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ideal}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A={}_I B\\leftrightarrow A\\mathbin{\\triangle}B\\in I\">\\(A={}_I B\\leftrightarrow A\\mathbin{\\triangle}B\\in I\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P_I\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/{=}_I)\\setminus\\{[\\varnothing]_I\\},\\leq_I\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P_I\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/{=}_I)\\setminus\\{[\\varnothing]_I\\},\\leq_I\\rangle\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]_I\\leq_I[B]_I\\leftrightarrow A\\setminus B\\in I\">\\([A]_I\\leq_I[B]_I\\leftrightarrow A\\setminus B\\in I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot U_G\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:[A]_I\\in\\dot G\\}\">\\(\\dot U_G\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:[A]_I\\in\\dot G\\}\\)</span> is the generic ultrafilter name</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> (良基关系谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f:\\delta\\to I\\;\n\\left(\\bigcup_{\\xi\\in\\delta}f(\\xi)\\in I\\right)\n\\land\\Vdash_{\\mathbb P_I}\n\\mathrm{WF}\\!\\left(\\in^{\\operatorname{Ult}(V,\\dot U_G)}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f:\\delta\\to I\\;\n\\left(\\bigcup_{\\xi\\in\\delta}f(\\xi)\\in I\\right)\n\\land\\Vdash_{\\mathbb P_I}\n\\mathrm{WF}\\!\\left(\\in^{\\operatorname{Ult}(V,\\dot U_G)}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideal is typed over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> and is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete,\nrather than merely countably complete.  The forcing conditions are\nquotient classes, matching the generic-ultrafilter name.</li>\n<li>末项是关于 generic ultrapower 的迫使语义，故断言明确标为元理论，而不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot G\">\\(\\dot G\\)</span> 当成地面模型中的对象变量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ideal}$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]) and $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ideal}$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]) and $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (良基关系谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A={}_I B\\leftrightarrow A\\mathbin{\\triangle}B\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P_I\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/{=}_I)\\setminus\\{[\\varnothing]_I\\},\\leq_I\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"[A]_I\\leq_I[B]_I\\leftrightarrow A\\setminus B\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot U_G\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:[A]_I\\in\\dot G\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\in I)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f:\\delta\\to I\\;\n\\left(\\bigcup_{\\xi\\in\\delta}f(\\xi)\\in I\\right)\n\\land\\Vdash_{\\mathbb P_I}\n\\mathrm{WF}\\!\\left(\\in^{\\operatorname{Ult}(V,\\dot U_G)}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot G","display":false}],"bytes":1899,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9a7faad353afdd1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","9e70b896da231f4f"]}